 INTRODUCTION


Overview
We currently rely on manual, fragmented tracking for QA audits and Team Leader daily activities, which creates administrative overhead and delays data analysis. This project proposes building an App Script-powered dashboard to automatically aggregate data from our existing audit and activity forms into a single, centralized hub.
Goals and Objective
To develop and deploy a unified dashboard that automates the capture and visualization of both QA audit results and daily Team Leader inputs (including coaching sessions, huddles, and floorwalks). This will eliminate manual data entry and provide a real-time, comprehensive view of leadership activities and team quality metrics.
Benefits
Time Savings: Drastically reduces the administrative hours spent manually tracking and compiling data.

Centralized Visibility: Consolidates QA and leadership activity metrics into a single source of truth.

Faster Decision-Making: Real-time data visualization allows for quicker performance analysis and proactive coaching.

Reduced Error: Automating data transfer minimizes the risk of human error inherent in manual tracking.



 PROCESS DOCUMENTATION


Existing Process

Currently, Team Leader (TL) inputs and activities are dispersed across multiple platforms, relying heavily on manual data entry via Google Forms. Tracking these activities is a laborious process that requires extracting and consolidating data from disparate sources. Furthermore, analyzing QA audits necessitates extensive manual spreadsheet manipulation, which creates workflow bottlenecks and delays the generation of actionable insights.

Proposed Process

We propose an automated, App Script-driven solution that consolidates all TL activities and QA audits into a unified platform. This dashboard will serve as the single source of truth for leaders to document their daily tasks and quickly evaluate performance trends.   

Key Functionalities Needed:   
Centralized Data Logging: A single platform for leaders to input and track daily activities without toggling between systems.   
Automated Data Aggregation: App Script integration to automatically pull form data into a central repository, eliminating manual exports. 
Real-Time Analytics Dashboard: Visual representation of audit data and TL activities to provide immediate, actionable insights without manual spreadsheet processing. 

